    'tour.s5.title': 'Build your day', 'tour.s5.body': 'The Schedule tab is where your plan lives. Switch between a single Day and the whole Week here — Day view is best for running today.',
    'tour.s6.title': 'Drop it on the timeline', 'tour.s6.body': 'Tap ＋ to place an activity at a real start–end time. Your committed self runs every block you add, perfectly on schedule. Drag a block to move it, pull its bottom edge to resize, or tap it to edit.',
    'tour.s7.title': 'Tap ✓ Done as you go', 'tour.s7.body': 'When you finish a block, check it off. This pill tracks today’s %, your ME bar inches ahead — bank more than the plan and a purple “overcharge” lights up.',
    'tour.s8.title': 'Need a break? Use a rest ticket', 'tour.s8.body': 'Life happens. Spend a rest ticket to excuse a task or a whole day — it won’t be graded and won’t break your streak. You get fresh ones each week.',
    'tour.s9.title': 'Build your streak', 'tour.s9.body': 'Progress logs every day you keep up, with a Mon–Sun strip and your streak. Stack the days and watch it grow week over week.',
    'tour.s10.title': 'Make it yours', 'tour.s10.body': 'On Avatar, give your committed self a name, a face (an emoji or your own photo), and a personality — gentle, drill-sergeant, or rival — that pushes you your way.',
    'tour.s11.title': 'Get a nudge on time', 'tour.s11.body': 'Turn on reminders and you’ll get a notification the moment each block starts (while the app is open), so you never miss the handoff. It’s free.',
    'tour.s12.title': 'See your weekly insights', 'tour.s12.body': 'JEK reads your real history and tells you what to fix each week — what you keep skipping, what to move or drop. Flip the Insights switch on your dashboard. (Pro)',
    'tour.s13.title': 'You’re all set', 'tour.s13.body': 'Add a couple of activities, schedule them, then tap ✓ Done through the day. Keep up with your committed self!',
    'onboard.title': 'Meet your committed self', 'onboard.intro': "This is the you that always sticks to the plan. Give them a name and a face — you'll race to keep up every day.", 'onboard.cta': 'Start training', 'ob.skip': 'Skip — I\'ll set up inside',
